/**
 * AppSettingsPage
 *
 * Global app-level settings that apply across all workspaces.
 *
 * Settings:
 * - Notifications
 * - About (version, updates)
 *
 * Note: AI settings (connections, model, thinking) have been moved to AiSettingsPage.
